'''Klefki''' (Japanese: '''クレッフィ''' ''Cleffy'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

